    class Schedule {
        +str day
        +list tasks
        +int total_time_minutes
        +None add_task(task: Task)
        +int get_total_duration() int
    }    
    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +Pet pet
        +list available_tasks
        + generate_plan() return - Schedule
        +list sort_tasks_by_priority() - str
    }



    Scheduler --> Schedule: Scheduler generates Schedule
    Schedule --> Task: Scheduler manages Tasks
    Scheduler --> Owner: Scheduler interacts with Owner
    Scheduler --> Pet: Scheduler considers Pet's needs

